prefix_rule(pattern=["/bin/zsh", "-lc", "{{HOME}}/.local/bin/wacli --store {{HOME}}/.wacli --lock-wait 30s send text --to 120363408965261061@g.us --message $'*Durable Knowledge Saved*\\n- *Family / Community*: saved the reusable *Belong owner / tenant handover* rule from *Elan Owners (TAG)*: the *owner moves out first*, then the *tenant moves in* so approvals can transfer.\\n- *Family / Community*: no new vendor entry was saved from *Elan Residents* because the extracted text did not include a reliable contact link.\\n- *Family / School*: I did not add a new school durable rule this round. The *outdoor activities* and *re-enrolment* updates are useful, but they read as current-term operational notices rather than stable standing knowledge.'"], decision="allow")
