prefix_rule(pattern=["/bin/zsh", "-lc", "{{HOME}}/.local/bin/wacli --store {{HOME}}/.wacli --lock-wait 30s send text --to 120363408965261061@g.us --message $'*Community / Home*\\n- *Elan Owners (TAG) addendum*: the strongest owner-facing thread was about the *north pool repair*. Residents said the repair used a *mismatched mosaic* because the original color was *out of stock*, and one reply said *MAF plans to replace the entire north pool mosaic in summer*.\\n- *Elan Owners (TAG) addendum*: there was also concern around *mosquitoes / dengue*, plus a side thread on *Take My Junk* pickup pricing, but the extracted replies were either cautionary or inconsistent rather than a stable reusable process.\\n- *TAG Home Automation addendum*: only one real new message appeared, a shared *Noon* product link asking for opinions, without any extracted conclusion or recommendation.'"], decision="allow")
